nted it to be. They delivered the cake in a timely manner, put the cake pulls in, and it was perfect!"},{"business_id":"0bSqRNkj7dkDifzfefvIPQ","review_id":"BftTxUuCeVkztjhFhBI1Qw","date":"2018-02-05T23:08:00","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9143806099891663,"text_excerpt":"I really love working with Shirelle and the team at Royal Cakery. I have used them exclusively for my special event cakes for the past 15 years and Shirelle never ever fails me. The cakes always taste better than I imagined, and will look above and beyond what my original idea may have been. Royal Cakery is always in high demand and her team works under tremendous pressure. They are busy baking ninjas, so you need to be patient with them while they gin out their creations, your patience will be worth the effort and will be rewarded. Because in the end, you will get a cake that will completely surpass your expectations. I have given Shirelle some out the box requests and she's always game...."},{"business_id":"0bSqRNkj7dkDifzfefvIPQ","review_id":"nsW6LgXjjzz1VIjGgdvjFw","date":"2019-06-02T12:58:18","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.897831916809082,"text_excerpt":"I was truly happy with my friend's sheet cake! It was not only beautifully decorated, but extremely fresh and delicious. This was a cake for his retirement from working 30 years! The buttercream icing was so tasty. It had to have been the best icing that I've ever tasted."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"0bSqRNkj7dkDifzfefvIPQ","photo_id":"NerNF_NvVkDc_iY6dtPOfQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/NerNF_NvVkDc_iY6dtPOfQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9262892603874207},{"business_id":"0bSqRNkj7dkDifzfefvIPQ","photo_id":"lxXWBsXcgAqBArdkZTmCFw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/lxXWBsXcgAqBArdkZTmCFw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9262892007827759}]},"notebook_case":null}
